@startuml 018-promotion-seq-lifecycle
title Promotion Banner Lifecycle (Admin Creation to Public Display)

actor Admin
actor "Guest / Customer" as Visitor
participant "AdminPromotionController" as AdminCtrl
participant "PublicPromotionController" as PubCtrl
participant "AdminPromotionService" as AdminSvc
participant "PromotionService" as PubSvc
database "Database" as DB

== 1. Create Promotion (Admin) ==
Admin -> AdminCtrl: POST /api/v1/admin/promotions\n{ title, ctaText, ctaUrl, colorTheme }
activate AdminCtrl
AdminCtrl -> AdminSvc: create(request)
activate AdminSvc

AdminSvc -> AdminSvc: validate/normalize (colorTheme, ctaUrl)
AdminSvc -> DB: INSERT promotions (isActive=true, sortOrder=0)
AdminSvc --> AdminCtrl: PromotionResponse
deactivate AdminSvc
AdminCtrl --> Admin: 201 Created
deactivate AdminCtrl

== 2. Toggle Active Status (Admin) ==
Admin -> AdminCtrl: PATCH /api/v1/admin/promotions/{id}/active\n{ isActive: false }
activate AdminCtrl
AdminCtrl -> AdminSvc: patchActive(id, false)
activate AdminSvc

AdminSvc -> DB: UPDATE promotions SET isActive=false WHERE id=?
AdminSvc --> AdminCtrl: PromotionResponse
deactivate AdminSvc
AdminCtrl --> Admin: 200 OK
deactivate AdminCtrl

== 3. Fetch Active Banners (Landing Page) ==
Visitor -> PubCtrl: GET /api/v1/promotions/active
activate PubCtrl
PubCtrl -> PubSvc: getActivePromotions()
activate PubSvc

PubSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM promotions\nWHERE isActive = true\nORDER BY sortOrder ASC, createdAt DESC
DB --> PubSvc: List<Promotion>
PubSvc --> PubCtrl: List<PromotionResponse>
deactivate PubSvc
PubCtrl --> Visitor: 200 OK
deactivate PubCtrl
@enduml
